# 3. DATABASE SCHEMA

## 3.1 users

Menggunakan tabel `users` standar Laravel dengan beberapa tambahan.

| Field         | Type            | Keterangan      |
| ------------- | --------------- | --------------- |
| id            | BIGINT UNSIGNED | PK              |
| name          | VARCHAR(150)    | Nama lengkap    |
| username      | VARCHAR(50)     | Username unik   |
| email         | VARCHAR(150)    | Email           |
| phone         | VARCHAR(30)     | Nomor HP        |
| password      | VARCHAR(255)    | Password hash   |
| avatar        | VARCHAR(255)    | Path avatar     |
| status        | ENUM            | active/inactive |
| last_login_at | DATETIME NULL   | Login terakhir  |
| created_at    | TIMESTAMP       |                 |
| updated_at    | TIMESTAMP       |                 |

Index:

```text
UNIQUE(username)
UNIQUE(email)
INDEX(status)
```

---

# 4. ROLE DAN PERMISSION

Saya merekomendasikan RBAC menggunakan tabel terpisah agar ke depan mudah ditambah role baru.

## 4.1 roles

```text
id
name
display_name
description
created_at
updated_at
```

Data awal:

```text
admin
reporter
redaktur
```

## 4.2 permissions

Contoh:

```text
dashboard.view

users.view
users.create
users.update
users.delete

roles.view
roles.create
roles.update
roles.delete

menus.view
menus.create
menus.update
menus.delete

pages.view
pages.create
pages.update
pages.delete
pages.publish

posts.view
posts.create
posts.update
posts.delete
posts.submit
posts.review
posts.approve
posts.reject
posts.publish
posts.unpublish

categories.view
categories.create
categories.update
categories.delete

tags.view
tags.create
tags.update
tags.delete

media.view
media.upload
media.update
media.delete

ratings.view
ratings.delete

contact.view
contact.update
contact.delete

settings.view
settings.update

activity_logs.view
```

## 4.3 role_user

```text
role_id
user_id
```

Composite primary key:

```text
PRIMARY KEY(role_id, user_id)
```

## 4.4 permission_role

```text
permission_id
role_id
```

Composite primary key:

```text
PRIMARY KEY(permission_id, role_id)
```

