# 9. POSTS

Tabel utama berita.

```text
id
author_id
category_id
featured_media_id

title
slug
excerpt
content

status

rejection_note

submitted_at
reviewed_at
published_at

reviewed_by
published_by

views

rating_average
rating_count

meta_title
meta_description

created_at
updated_at
```

## 9.1 Status

```text
draft
submitted
review
approved
published
rejected
archived
```

Workflow:

```text
draft
  │
  │ submit
  ▼
submitted
  │
  │ review
  ▼
review
  │
  ├──────── reject ────────► rejected
  │                              │
  │                              │ edit
  │                              ▼
  │                            draft
  │
  └──────── approve ───────► approved
                                │
                                │ publish
                                ▼
                             published
```

---

# 10. POST_TAG

Relasi many-to-many antara berita dan tag.

```text
post_id
tag_id
```

Primary key:

```text
PRIMARY KEY(post_id, tag_id)
```

---

# 11. MEDIA

Media Library.

```text
id
uploaded_by
filename
original_name
disk
path
mime_type
size
width
height
alt_text
caption
created_at
updated_at
```

Contoh:

```text
storage/app/public/media/2026/08/berita-001.webp
```

Sebaiknya menggunakan Laravel Storage sehingga storage dapat dipindahkan ke object storage/CDN di masa depan.

---

# 12. POST_MEDIA

Untuk relasi berita dengan banyak gambar.

```text
post_id
media_id
sort_order
```

Contoh:

```text
Berita A
 ├── foto-01
 ├── foto-02
 ├── foto-03
 └── foto-04
```

---

# 13. RATINGS

```text
id
post_id
rating
visitor_hash
session_hash
created_at
updated_at
```

Validasi:

```text
rating BETWEEN 1 AND 5
```

Index:

```text
INDEX(post_id)
INDEX(visitor_hash)
```

Untuk mencegah spam dapat digunakan kombinasi:

```text
visitor_hash
+
session_hash
+
rate limiting
```

---

# 14. CONTACT_MESSAGES

```text
id
name
email
phone
subject
message
status
admin_note
handled_by
handled_at
created_at
updated_at
```

Status:

```text
new
read
in_progress
resolved
archived
```

Aturan validasi:

```text
email OR phone harus tersedia
```

