# 25. ENDPOINT AJAX / API

Endpoint dibagi berdasarkan modul.

Semua endpoint CMS menggunakan prefix:

```text
/api/admin/*
/api/reporter/*
/api/redaktur/*
/api/frontend/*
```

---

# 26. AUTHENTICATION ENDPOINT

| Method | Endpoint           | Fungsi                 |
| ------ | ------------------ | ---------------------- |
| POST   | `/login`           | Login                  |
| POST   | `/logout`          | Logout                 |
| POST   | `/forgot-password` | Request reset password |
| POST   | `/reset-password`  | Reset password         |

---

# 27. ADMIN — USER

| Method | Endpoint                               | Fungsi         |
| ------ | -------------------------------------- | -------------- |
| GET    | `/api/admin/users`                     | List user      |
| POST   | `/api/admin/users`                     | Tambah user    |
| GET    | `/api/admin/users/{id}`                | Detail         |
| PUT    | `/api/admin/users/{id}`                | Update         |
| DELETE | `/api/admin/users/{id}`                | Hapus          |
| PATCH  | `/api/admin/users/{id}/status`         | Aktif/nonaktif |
| POST   | `/api/admin/users/{id}/reset-password` | Reset password |

---

# 28. ADMIN — ROLE

| Method | Endpoint                            | Fungsi            |
| ------ | ----------------------------------- | ----------------- |
| GET    | `/api/admin/roles`                  | List role         |
| POST   | `/api/admin/roles`                  | Tambah            |
| PUT    | `/api/admin/roles/{id}`             | Update            |
| DELETE | `/api/admin/roles/{id}`             | Hapus             |
| PUT    | `/api/admin/roles/{id}/permissions` | Update permission |

