# 29. ADMIN — MENU

| Method | Endpoint                       | Fungsi              |
| ------ | ------------------------------ | ------------------- |
| GET    | `/api/admin/menus`             | Ambil struktur menu |
| POST   | `/api/admin/menus`             | Tambah menu         |
| PUT    | `/api/admin/menus/{id}`        | Edit                |
| DELETE | `/api/admin/menus/{id}`        | Hapus               |
| PATCH  | `/api/admin/menus/{id}/status` | Aktif/nonaktif      |
| PATCH  | `/api/admin/menus/reorder`     | Reorder menu        |
| PATCH  | `/api/admin/menus/{id}/move`   | Pindah parent       |

`reorder` menerima array ID dan posisi.

Contoh:

```json
{
    "items": [
        {
            "id": 1,
            "parent_id": null,
            "sort_order": 1
        },
        {
            "id": 2,
            "parent_id": 1,
            "sort_order": 1
        }
    ]
}
```

